introduction":{"state":"observed","value":"北京市大兴区林校路街道养老服务中心（以下简称“林校路街道养老服务中心”）是在林校路街道办事处领导组织下成立的枢纽型养老服务综合体，是本市三级居家社区养老服务网络的重要组成部分，具备养老服务供需对接、调度监管、社区餐厅、老年学堂、康养娱乐、集中养老等功能。 林校路街道养老服务中心在林校路街道办事处领导组织下发挥着区域养老服务统筹职责，为辖区老年人提供综合性、普惠性、专业化养老服务。 一中心·两院区 布局 林校路街道养老服务中心采用“一中心、两院区” 布局，集托养、医养、文娱、餐饮、综合服务于一体，共设置五大功能分区：综合服务区、托养服务区、社区餐厅、老年学堂、医养服务区，可提供长期托养、日间照料、助餐服务、文化娱乐等一站式养老服务。","observationCount":1},"service":{"content":{"state":"observed","value":"长期托养，日间照料，文化娱乐，社区餐厅，综合服务","observationCount":1},"team":{"state":"observed","value":"专业团队，经验丰富，持证上岗","observationCount":1},"hours":{"state":"observed","value":"托养服务24小时","observationCount":1},"scope":{"state":"observed","value":"大兴区林校路街道","observationCount":1},"explanation":{"state":"observed","value":"无","observationCount":1}},"beds":{"total":{"state":"observed","value":36,"observationCount":1},"dayCare":{"state":"observed","value":0,"observationCount":1},"fullCare":{"state":"observed","value":36,"observationCount":1},"nursing":{"state":"observed","value":36,"observationCount":1}},"feeSummary":[{"code":"04","label":"月总费用","range":{"state":"observed","value":[3800,6600],"observationCount":1},"description":{"state":"observed","value":"月总费用，无其他收费","observationCount":1}},{"code":"02","label":"床位费用","range":{"state":"observed","value":[1600,2800],"observationCount":1},"description":{"state":"observed","value":"多人间-单人间","observationCount":1}},{"code":"01","label":"护理费用","range":{"state":"observed","value":[1000,2600],"observationCount":1},"description":{"state":"observed","value":"能力完好-重度失能","observationCount":1}},{"code":"03","label":"膳食费用","range":{"state":"observed","value":[1200,1200],"observationCount":1},"description":{"state":"observed","value":"三餐两点","observationCount":1}}],"charges":{"state":"observed","value":[],"observationCount":1},"subServices":{"respite":{"beds":{"state":"missing","value":null,"observationCount":0},"nursingBeds":{"state":"missing","value":null,"observationCount":0},"fee":{"state":"missing","value":null,"observatio